 Chứng minh rằng $\widehat{EIH}=90^{\circ}+\dfrac{\widehat{EAH} }{2};\widehat{HIA}=90^{\circ}+\dfrac{\widehat{HEA}}{2};\widehat{AIE}=90^{\circ}+\dfrac{\widehat{AHE}}{2}$ 

